        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, district heat, average</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, district heat, average
This process is made for a district heat system. The heat input is not included and must be added for the specific district heat system.;
UUID: 7940d64f-9c6b-3a93-8955-811533ded804
Included is the infrastructure of the deliverysystem for district heat and the energy input which is used for the transport of the heat, calculated on 1 MJ.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7940d64f-9c6b-3a93-8955-811533ded804.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
